# Permanent riichi furiten from passing an opponent's discard persists past the next own draw
# (engine.md §4.1 furiten, rules.md §4.28).
# Seat 0 declares double riichi (waiting 4s/7s).
# Seat 1 discards 4s -> Seat 0 has legal ron but passes -> permanent riichi furiten!
# Seats 2, 3 tsumogiri; Seat 0 draws 1z and tsumogiris -> STILL furiten after own draw!
# Seat 1 discards 7s -> Seat 0 is still furiten (assert_illegal ron, assert_not_asked).
# Seats 2, 3 tsumogiri; Seat 0 draws 7s -> wins by tsumo!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + tsumo 7s (dora ind 1z, ura ind 1z -> 0 dora)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + tsumo (1) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 5 han (Mangan)
#   Dealer Mangan tsumo: 4000 all (+12000; recovers own 1000 stick -> net +12000).

